Once you have Magic Resistance, I would wait until reaching the top of
Sokoban before wishing for reflection.  After that I still might not
wish for reflection, although it is very nice to have.


>
> 4. 5000 gold pieces so I can get some divine protection. After all,
> only at Exp 5 right now.

There is a lot of gold in the dungeon.  You don't need to wish for
it.  BAJ is correct, use a pet to harvest gold from shops or possibly
don't even worry about it with your new gear.

>
> I'm open to these and any other suggestions.

If you don't get a bag of holding from Sokoban, it might be handy to
wish for a blessed gresed bag of holding.  That will save you some
inventory management concerns

Another half-thought thought is that if you like pets (and have wishes
to spare), you could wish for a magic whistle.  Find a polytrap
(protected by your MR) and try to get a purple worm.  My current game
has a pet purple worm and I'm having a lot of fun with it.

